@user that might be one of the worst insults I've ever gotten lol but anyway, it's dangerous to associate a universal idea like believing in God with a certain group. Like oh, you believe this, so you're part of x. 
You cannot believe in this and belong to y. These ideas belong to Group X and these to Y. There can be no crossovers.

It takes away room for nuance and just builds a cult like mentality.

