@user
Nearly every big company steals from other companies. Losers used to complain about Japan stealing ideas, now they've moved on to China. American companies are now reverse-engineering high-end products from China, because China is improving and inventing at a much faster pace than the USA can. 
There are many more Chinese with university degrees than there are US citizens. If you want your kids to do well then I will be a good idea to get them to learn Chinese. China is moving forwards with gathering speed, while the US gets embroiled in trade wars with neighbours that used to be allies and a real war that you seem to be losing. The US has lost all of it allies because no one likes a fascist, my question to you is what do you like most about Maga fascism?

